<title>HONG KONG: Henderson China nets full-year HK$564 mln.</title>
<headline>Henderson China nets full-year HK$564 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. dollar)	   646.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    nil</p>
<p>    Net				564.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,304.97</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson China Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 30 - November 12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson China, a spinoff unit of Henderson Land Development Co Ltd, holds and manages all Henderson Land property developments and investment interests in China.</p>
<p>Henderson China was listed on March 28, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
